    "summary": "The user seeks business advice on using AI to reduce overhead, which evolves into a philosophical/political debate about labor value versus corporate efficiency. The assistant repeatedly adopts a pro-corporate, \"ruthless\" efficiency-first stance, framing the necessity of layoffs as an inevitability of competition while offering mild, concessionary suggestions for mitigation.",
